WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.240
Someone just stole your phone.

2
00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:05.873
Say they even get past Face ID.

3
00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:11.503
Your guardian only co-signs up to your daily limit. Anything bigger gets refused.

4
00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:16.769
And raising that limit needs your hardware wallet. Which they don't have.

5
00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:25.069
So at most, they get your daily limit. Start a recovery with your hardware wallet, and phone payments pause.

6
00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:29.250
Trikey. Pre-alpha, and building in public.
